      "date": "2026-11-18 05:43:47.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(3 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good. The recheck closes the race as described, and the ordering holds: ext4 does not reuse a freed block until its transaction commits, and by then the inode on the device already shows the new i_file_acl or generation. A few optional comments inline for the next refresh; no need to re-spin for them.",
